        {
          "exampleId": "w:someone#e-78204e8ee8354574",
          "text": "One reason was: “You’ll actually show up if you know someone is waiting for you at the gym,” while another read: “__36__” With a workout partner, you will increase your training effort as there is a subtle (微妙) competition.",
